    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27351" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διπλάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διπλασιάζω</span>
			, <i>double,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					4.11
				</span></i>
			 (s. v. l.), <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				122
			</span></i>: —
				Pass.
			, <i>to be doubled,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατηλάταις δορὸς διπλάζεται τιμά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					781
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				319.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>to be twofold</i> or <i>double,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τό τοι διπλάζον μεῖζον κακόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					268
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
